**Requirements** The *holy steam ball* is filled with evaporated [Holy Water](/item/holy-water-gm-core) and incense smoke;

**Effect** You release the stored steam and smoke to grant yourself its protections. Each use of the *holy steam ball* lasts for 1 hour and gives you a +2 item bonus to Will saving throws against possession effects from fiends and undead and effects from fiends and undead that cause the [Controlled](/condition/controlled-player-core) condition.

[Effect: Holy Steam Ball](/condition/effect-holy-steam-ball-guns-and-gears-remastered)
